-688-cuengi-but-dad-is-healthy-though","title":"Chapter 688: Cuengi, but Dad is healthy though?"},{"chapter_id":62222574,"n_sort":692,"slug":"chapter-689-you-rascal-i-wont-let-you-have-my-lara","title":"Chapter 689: You rascal! I won&#039;t let you have my Lara!"},{"chapter_id":62240862,"n_sort":693,"slug":"chapter-690-damn-im-jealous","title":"Chapter 690: Damn. I&#039;m jealous."},{"chapter_id":62257270,"n_sort":694,"slug":"chapter-691-no-i-cant-say-hello-because-of-vice-chairman-theo","title":"Chapter 691: No. I can&#039;t say hello because of Vice Chairman Theo."},{"chapter_id":62257271,"n_sort":695,"slug":"chapter-692-whos-the-boss-here","title":"Chapter 692: Who\u2019s the boss here?!"},{"chapter_id":62257272,"n_sort":696,"slug":"chapter-693-how-long-do-i-have-to-be-the-youngest","title":"Chapter 693: How long do I have to be the youngest..."},{"chapter_id":62320099,"n_sort":697,"slug":"chapter-694-vice-chairman-theo-did-you-sell-these","title":"Chapter 694: Vice Chairman Theo, did you sell these?!"},{"chapter_id":62320100,"n_sort":698,"slug":"chapter-695-can-i-finally-meet-you-now","title":"Chapter 695: Can I finally meet you now?"},{"chapter_id":62320101,"n_sort":699,"slug":"chapter-696-thank-you-for-being-born","title":"Chapter 696: Thank You for Being Born."},{"chapter_id":62325547,"n_sort":700,"slug":"chapter-697-guys-strike-master-bos-soles-thoroughly","title":"Chapter 697: Guys, strike Master Bo\u2019s soles thoroughly!"},{"chapter_id":62325548,"n_sort":701,"slug":"chapter-698-those-who-try-to-ruin-the-wedding-in-the-name-of-love-and-justice-i-will-not-forgive-you","title":"Chapter 698: Those who try to ruin the wedding! In the name of love and justice, I will not forgive you!"},{"chapter_id":62325549,"n_sort":702,"slug":"chapter-699-it-belongs-to-great-blackie","title":"Chapter 699: It Belongs to Great Blackie!"},{"chapter_id":62352920,"n_sort":703,"slug":"chapter-700-welcome-is-this-your-first-time-with-supplements","title":"Chapter 700: Welcome. Is t